n\nThe terminal's clipped appearance likely results from the cumulative height of the top bar, page header (with its significant padding/margin), and active provider banner, consuming excessive vertical space within the server management screen. This reduces the available space for the terminal. Redesigning to reduce the size of these elements should improve visibility.\n\n\nThe excessive vertical space taken by the banner and server card elements is pushing the terminal off-screen, requiring scrolling. Reducing the banner height and compacting the server card details and actions are necessary. This will improve visibility of both server cards and terminal without scrolling.\n\n\nCard elements consume excessive vertical space. Reducing card heights from 420px to approximately 180px and the banner height will provide more room. Placing the terminal beneath the cards, giving it a fixed height, ensures its visibility. Re-layout of the elements within the server management screen is needed. This will fit on smaller screens.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"grep_search","args":{"MatchPerLine":true,"Query":"showCustomConfirm","SearchPath":"D:\\AI_Engineer\\Pharmacy-agy\\desktop_app\\templates\\index.html","toolAction":"Searching for showCustomConfirm in index.html","toolSummary":"Grep showCustomConfirm"}}]}
